    /* FAQ PAGE */
    faq_tag:"FAQ",
    faq_h1:"Frequently Asked Questions",
    faq_sub:"Everything you need to know about AI automation, autonomous AI agents, and DMC IA services for businesses across Portugal and Europe.",
    faq_h2_all:"All Questions",
    faq_cat1:"General — AI Automation",
    faq_cat2:"DMC IA Services",
    faq_cat3:"Technical Questions",
    faq_q1:"What is AI automation?",
    faq_a1:"AI automation uses artificial intelligence systems to perform business tasks automatically — replacing manual, repetitive work with intelligent agents that can process data, make decisions, and execute workflows without human intervention.",
    faq_q2:"What is an autonomous AI agent?",
    faq_a2:"An autonomous AI agent is an AI system that perceives information, plans actions, makes independent decisions, and executes multi-step tasks continuously without human supervision. DMC IA builds custom autonomous agents for specific business workflows.",
    faq_q3:"How is AI automation different from traditional automation?",
    faq_a3:"Traditional automation follows rigid rules and scripts. AI automation handles variability, processes unstructured data, adapts to new situations, makes intelligent decisions, and continuously improves — making it far more powerful for real business complexity.",
    faq_q4:"What business processes can be automated with AI?",
    faq_a4:"Customer support, invoice processing, appointment scheduling, inventory management, email management, data entry, report generation, lead qualification, marketing campaigns, order processing, and hundreds of other recurring business tasks.",
    faq_q5:"What results can I expect from AI automation?",
    faq_a5:"Typical results include 30–70% reduction in time spent on automated processes, 90%+ reduction in process errors, significant labour cost savings, and full ROI within 3–6 months of deployment.",
    faq_q6:"What is the difference between AI automation and hiring more staff?",
    faq_a6:"AI automation operates 24/7, scales instantly, makes no errors from fatigue, and has zero ongoing cost per task processed. It replaces the operational cost of repetitive work without the management overhead, HR risk, or performance variability of additional staff.",
    faq_q7:"Can AI automation help a small business?",
    faq_a7:"Yes. AI automation delivers the highest ROI for small businesses because it replaces work that would otherwise require additional staff. DMC IA specifically designs solutions for SMEs with 5–200 employees.",
    faq_q8:"How long does it take to deploy AI automation?",
    faq_a8:"Simple automations can go live in 1–2 weeks. Complex multi-system AI automation projects typically take 4–8 weeks. DMC IA manages the entire deployment process.",
    faq_q9:"Do I need technical staff to use AI automation?",
    faq_a9:"No. DMC IA handles all technical aspects of building, deploying, and maintaining AI automation systems. You interact with business results, not technology.",
    faq_q10:"How much does AI automation cost?",
    faq_a10:"Costs vary by complexity and scope. DMC IA offers solutions starting from small automation projects for individual workflows up to complete business automation systems. Contact us for a free audit and tailored proposal.",
    faq_q11:"What industries does DMC IA serve?",
    faq_a11:"DMC IA serves restaurants, ecommerce businesses, real estate agencies, medical offices, startups, professional services firms, and any SME with repetitive operational workflows.",
    faq_q12:"Which countries does DMC IA operate in?",
    faq_a12:"DMC IA serves clients in Portugal, France, Belgium, Switzerland, Luxembourg, and across Europe. Services are available in Portuguese, French, and English.",
    faq_q13:"Does AI automation require ongoing maintenance?",
    faq_a13:"Yes, and DMC IA provides ongoing system monitoring, optimisation, and updates as part of our service. AI systems require maintenance to stay current with your business changes and to continuously improve performance.",
    faq_q14:"Is AI automation secure?",
    faq_a14:"Yes. DMC IA builds AI systems with strict security controls, permission boundaries, encrypted data handling, and complete audit logs. Security is a core design requirement for every system we deploy.",
    faq_q15:"Can AI automation integrate with my existing software?",
    faq_a15:"Yes. DMC IA integrates with CRM systems, ERP platforms, accounting software, email tools, ecommerce platforms, databases, and custom APIs. Integration with your existing stack is a core part of every deployment.",
    faq_q16:"What is workflow automation?",
    faq_a16:"Workflow automation connects multiple steps, systems, and decisions in a business process and executes them automatically from trigger to completion — without manual handoffs or human intervention at each stage.",
    faq_q17:"How does AI inventory management work?",
    faq_a17:"AI inventory management uses machine learning to predict demand, monitor stock levels, and automatically trigger supplier reorders when stock reaches an AI-calculated threshold — preventing stockouts and excess inventory simultaneously.",
    faq_q18:"What is AI customer support automation?",
    faq_a18:"AI customer support automation deploys intelligent agents that handle customer queries, complaints, bookings, and requests automatically — across email, chat, and messaging channels — 24 hours a day, 7 days a week.",
    faq_q19:"What is administrative AI automation?",
    faq_a19:"Administrative AI automation handles back-office tasks like invoicing, appointment scheduling, data entry, document processing, and email management automatically — freeing your team from routine administrative work.",
    faq_cta_h2:"Still have questions?",
    faq_cta_p:"Talk to us directly. Get a free AI audit and a clear answer about what AI automation can do for your specific business.",

