    about_sub:"DMC IA is an AI automation brand. We build autonomous AI agents, workflow automation systems, and intelligent business operations for SMEs across Portugal and Europe — delivering technology that was previously only accessible to large enterprises, at a scale and price that works for small and medium businesses.",
